An '''Imperial doonium refinery''' was a [[doonium]] [[Mining|mine]] and [[refinery]] constructed<ref name="Devil's Deal" /> near the [[Tann Province]]<ref name="Dawn VG">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> on [[Ryloth]] by the [[Galactic Empire]] shortly after its [[Proclamation of the New Order|formation]]<ref name="Devil's Deal" /> in [[19 BBY]].<ref name="SWGA">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> The Empire claimed that the refinery would bring jobs to the [[Twi'lek]] population, and it was intended as the first of many sites. However, locals such as [[Eleni Syndulla]] and [[Gobi Glie]] were suspicious of the Empire's motives, noting that the new government was being very secretive for a group which was trying to claim they had nothing to hide. Syndulla further found the refinery's [[turbolaser]]s and use of military personnel concerning, as the Empire had claimed it was not a military outpost.<ref name="Devil's Deal" />

==Description==
The doonium refinery was a large [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] installation built on the [[planet]] [[Ryloth]] in [[19 BBY]], and was the first of many planned sites. Massive pipelines ran into the the depths of a large [[mountain]] and extracted doonium back into the installation to be refined. The bulk of the refinery's workforce was made up of the native [[Twi'lek]] population. The refinery was defended by several [[turbolaser]]s and a [[garrison]] of [[Clone trooper|clone]] [[stormtrooper]]s.<ref name="Devil's Deal" />

